  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7304.02 Length of Loan. A municipality in receipt of an exceptional disaster relief loan shall remit the anticipated FEMA assistance to the state treasurer within 15 days of its receipt.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #13168, 2-19-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c7300.html"
